# Play test of Ranger's Rest (CIPlay rangers_rest, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Ranger's Rest
expect step 0
expect title Old Scar

# From the north beach up the trail to the station on its terrace, round the cabin to the porch
walk 10 26 to 12 14 to 14 8 to 18 3.6 to 29.5 3.6 to 29.5 -2 h=10.5
zone station
expect step 0
expect message stove is cold
read Ranger's diary
expect step 1

# The ranger's two goats by the campfire behind the cabin
catch Goat 2
expect step 2

# The watchtower beside the station: its ladder, the deck
walk 29.5 -4 to 29.5 -8.2 to 23 -9.2 to 19.5 -15.3 h=10.4
climb 19 -14.75
expect stand 19 -12 h=16.1
zone tower
expect step 3
expect message cave mouth on the south shore

# Down to the den: Old Scar wakes, is driven off; the stolen crate
walk 12 -26 to 6 -27
zone den
expect message reeks of bear
kill Bear
expect step 4
expect animals Bear 0
open Ranger's stash
expect done
expect item Machete 1
expect item Bow 1
